  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The family unit is mapped as pedophiles",
  "description": "The top text 'there's a reason they have children.' is juxtaposed with the visual of a happy family embracing. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity 'family_embrace' is implicitly mapped to the textual entity 'pedophile_stereotype' through the false association implied by the bottom text 'they are pedophiles'. The meme uses the visual of a loving family to falsely equate parenting with pedophilia, which is a harmful stereotype and a form of hate speech. The mapping is established by the textual claim that directly attributes the label 'pedophiles' to the visual family unit.",
